# Baby Tracker — Frontend Rules

## Architecture

- `src/App.tsx` is the ENTIRE frontend (~2000 lines). One `App()` function. No sub-components.
- Do NOT create `src/components/` unless a plan explicitly calls for it.
- All state lives in `App()`. No Redux, Zustand, or external state library.
- 4-tab bottom nav: `activeTab: 'log' | 'timeline' | 'dashboards' | 'settings'`
- Bottom sheets for data entry: `activeSheet: 'bottle' | 'diaper' | 'sleep' | 'activity' | 'weight' | 'edit' | null`
- Open a sheet: `openAddSheet('bottle')` / `openEditSheet(event)`
- Known type gap: `'sleep' as any` in `activeSheet` — intentional, do not fix or flag.

## API Calls

Native `fetch()` only. No axios, no react-query. Always relative paths (`/api/...`).

```typescript
const res = await fetch('/api/events', {
  method: 'POST',
  headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
  body: JSON.stringify(payload),
});
if (res.ok) { showToast('נשמר בהצלחה'); } else { showToast('תקלה בשמירה'); }
```

Every API handler is `async` and follows this pattern:
```typescript
const handleSomething = async () => {
  setSubmitting(true);
  try { /* fetch */ } catch { showToast('שגיאה'); } finally { setSubmitting(false); }
};
```

## Toast & Confirmations

- `showToast('message')` — 3.5s auto-dismiss. All user feedback goes here.
- `showUndoToast(eventId, message)` — toast with undo action (4s window, calls DELETE).
- Never use `alert()` or `window.confirm()`. Use inline Hebrew confirm UI with `pendingDeleteId` state instead.

## TypeScript

- Strict types always. No `any` (except the `sleep as any` known case).
- All types in `src/types.ts`. Never inline interfaces in `App.tsx`.

## Icons & Animation

- Icons: Lucide React only. Import individually: `import { Moon, Trash2 } from 'lucide-react'`
- Never use emoji as interactive UI elements.
- Animation: `import { motion, AnimatePresence } from 'motion/react'` — NOT `framer-motion`.

## CSS

- Tailwind v4. No `tailwind.config.js` — do not create one.
- Custom classes in `src/index.css` via `@theme` directive.
- Conditional classes with template literals — no `classnames` library:
  ```tsx
  className={`base-classes ${condition ? 'active-classes' : 'inactive-classes'}`}
  ```

## Hebrew & RTL

- All user-facing strings in Hebrew. Code, comments, console logs in English.
- Root `<div>` has `dir="rtl"` — don't re-set on children unless overriding for a specific element.
- Timezone display: `Asia/Jerusalem`. Storage: always UTC.
- Hebrew typography: `״` (U+05F4) for abbreviations (מ״ל, ק״ג), `׳` (U+05F3) for single quotes.

Common strings:
| Use | Hebrew |
|-----|--------|
| Saved | נשמר בהצלחה |
| Error saving | תקלה בשמירה |
| Loading | טוען... |
| Delete | מחק |
| Cancel | ביטול |
| Save | שמור |
| Error | שגיאה |
